&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Technically assess the feasibility and approach for customer monitoring use cases and integrations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Explores and researches new technologies to integrate and monitor with LogicMonitor&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Builds accurate estimates for services proposals, including hours effort, timeframe and pricing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
