&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Comfortable owning a number (consumption, pipeline, T CV) jointly with sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Experience marketing usage-based or consumption-priced products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Hands-on with an inference API, open-weight models or a speech API; can run a demo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;from the terminal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Background at a hosted-inference, speech, GPU cloud company , or marketing against&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;them.&lt;/li&gt;
