&lt;div class=&quot;page&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;layoutArea&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;column&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the Role&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ogilvy Health is looking for a highly organised and proactive Senior Account Executive to join our Medical Communications team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will sit within a high-profile global neurology and immunology account, supporting the delivery of scientifically robust, strategically aligned programmes that help improve outcomes for patients and healthcare professionals worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Account Executive, you will play a pivotal role in ensuring projects are delivered efficiently, on time and to the highest standard. You will work closely with clients, scientific colleagues, healthcare professionals and cross-functional agency teams, taking ownership of project delivery while developing your strategic, scientific and client management expertise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an excellent opportunity for an ambitious medical communications professional looking to accelerate their career as part of a collaborative, scientifically driven and creatively focused team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the day-to-day delivery of a global neurology and immunology account, ensuring projects are delivered on time, on budget and to the highest standard.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with clients, healthcare professionals and internal teams, becoming a trusted and reliable partner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate a wide range of medical communications activities, from publications and medical education programmes to congresses, advisory boards and events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with scientific, creative and digital colleagues to bring complex science to life in meaningful ways.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of project plans, timelines and budgets, proactively managing priorities and keeping programmes moving forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop your therapy area expertise and contribute to strategic discussions that help shape client programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and mentor junior team members while continuing to grow your own medical communications career.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What You’ll Need&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within a medical communications, healthcare communications or healthcare agency environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management skills with the ability to manage multiple priorities and deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and relationship-building skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A keen interest in science, healthcare and the pharmaceutical industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence working with cross-functional teams and a range of stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail and a proactive, solutions-focused mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial awareness and an understanding of budgets and project delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative approach and a desire to learn and develop within a fast-paced agency environment.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;How We’ll Support You&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ogilvy celebrates its people. Fully. Enthusiastically. Unhesitatingly. We’ll empower you with the tools you’ll need to succeed. We’ll give you the autonomy to seek out new paths and better ways of doing things. We’ll support you with colleagues who are experts in their disciplines, drawn from across the Ogilvy network. And we’ll provide opportunities for you to do work of which you’ll be proud, with people you’ll be proud to call your teammates.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
